            "Titles": {
                "eng": "The Final Chapter",
                "jpn": null
            },
            "Summaries": {
                "eng": "A century after the merging of the three worlds, the true Chōjin is born, creating a hermaphroditic race to destroy all remaining life on Earth. Akemi awakens in a hospital beside Jyaku, who barely survived his clash with the ever-shifting Chōjin. The Destroyer God Tatsuo, thought dead, returns and continues his destruction. Still in love with him, Akemi sets out to find Tatsuo, while Jyaku battles the Chōjin’s new immortal offspring. When Akemi finally reaches Tatsuo, he nearly kills her, but Jyaku intervenes at the last moment, only to be condemned by her for doing so. Witnessing the devastation and the Chōjin’s corruption, Jyaku loses faith and ultimately declares war on the god he once served, setting the stage for humanity’s final resistance.",
